1
00:00:01,571 --> 00:00:03,448
( overlapping chatter, yelling )

2
00:00:03,448 --> 00:00:06,034
♪

3
00:00:12,123 --> 00:00:14,084
( Johnny Black giggles )

4
00:00:14,084 --> 00:00:16,044
( Kirito gasps ) ASUNA!

5
00:00:19,214 --> 00:00:21,091
WATCH OUT!

6
00:00:23,343 --> 00:00:25,470
( Asuna gasps )

7
00:00:25,470 --> 00:00:27,180
Kirito: RUN! GET OUTTA HERE!

8
00:00:32,644 --> 00:00:34,688
- ( hypodermic hisses )
- ( Asuna gasps )

9
00:00:35,730 --> 00:00:36,690
( gasps )

10
00:00:38,942 --> 00:00:40,402
( Kirito grunts )

11
00:00:43,947 --> 00:00:45,532
Asuna: KIRITO!

12
00:00:52,414 --> 00:00:54,958
( shuddering )

13
00:00:54,958 --> 00:00:56,876
♪

14
00:01:03,883 --> 00:01:04,926
( running footsteps )

15
00:01:04,926 --> 00:01:06,636
( Suguha panting )

16
00:01:06,636 --> 00:01:07,429
ASUNA!

17
00:01:10,432 --> 00:01:12,559
Asuna: MRS. KIRIGAYA.

18
00:01:12,559 --> 00:01:13,893
SUGUHA.

19
00:01:29,743 --> 00:01:32,954
( all gasp )

20
00:01:32,954 --> 00:01:34,623
( ventilator hissing )

21
00:01:38,752 --> 00:01:41,463
Doctor: HE’S STABLE
AND OUT OF DANGER NOW.

22
00:01:41,463 --> 00:01:43,590
Midori: THANK GOODNESS.

23
00:01:43,590 --> 00:01:45,634
Doctor: THAT SAID,
HIS HEART DID STOP

24
00:01:45,634 --> 00:01:48,678
FOR MORE THAN FIVE MINUTES,
SO THERE’S A STRONG CHANCE

25
00:01:48,678 --> 00:01:50,680
HE’S SUFFERED
SOME DEGREE OF BRAIN DAMAGE.

26
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,015
( both gasp )

27
00:01:52,015 --> 00:01:54,267
NOW, WE DON’T KNOW
ANYTHING FOR SURE YET,

28
00:01:54,267 --> 00:01:55,977
BUT IT’S POSSIBLE
HE COULD HAVE

29
00:01:55,977 --> 00:01:59,064
A PERMANENT MENTAL
AND/OR PHYSICAL DISABILITY

30
00:01:59,064 --> 00:02:02,108
OR, WORST CASE,
HE NEVER REGAINS CONSCIOUSNESS.

31
00:02:02,108 --> 00:02:04,444
- ( Asuna gasps )
- Suguha: NO!

32
00:02:04,444 --> 00:02:06,696
Doctor: UNTIL HE HAS AN MRI,

33
00:02:06,696 --> 00:02:10,408
WE WON’T KNOW THE SCOPE
OF THE DAMAGE, IF THERE IS ANY.

34
00:02:10,408 --> 00:02:11,826
HE’LL HAVE TO BE TRANSFERRED

35
00:02:11,826 --> 00:02:13,953
TO A BETTER EQUIPPED FACILITY
FOR THAT.

36
00:02:13,953 --> 00:02:17,374
IF YOU FOLLOW ME, I CAN GET YOU
STARTED ON THE PAPERWORK.

37
00:02:17,374 --> 00:02:18,375
Midori: OKAY.

38
00:02:22,879 --> 00:02:25,215
( Asuna shudders )

39
00:02:28,843 --> 00:02:31,513
Kikuoka: HELLO, ASUNA. SUGUHA.

40
00:02:34,057 --> 00:02:36,184
Asuna: MR. KIKUOKA.

41
00:02:36,184 --> 00:02:37,894
Kikuoka:
ARE KIRITO’S PARENTS HERE?

42
00:02:37,894 --> 00:02:40,021
I’D LIKE A WORD.

43
00:02:40,021 --> 00:02:41,064
♪

44
00:02:41,064 --> 00:02:43,900
♪ SHINY SWORD, MY DIAMOND ♪

45
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:45,527
( singing in Japanese )

46
00:02:56,913 --> 00:02:57,914
♪ IT’S TIME ♪

47
00:02:57,914 --> 00:02:59,833
( singing in Japanese )

48
00:03:15,724 --> 00:03:17,684
♪

49
00:04:20,473 --> 00:04:21,803
Suguha: SORRY I’M LATE!

50
00:04:25,723 --> 00:04:27,603
Asuna: ISN’T YOUR MOM COMING?

51
00:04:27,603 --> 00:04:29,773
Suguha: SHE’S STILL TRYING
TO FIND A PARKING SPOT.

52
00:04:29,773 --> 00:04:32,023
SHE WANTS US TO SIGN IN
AND WAIT FOR HER IN THE LOBBY.

53
00:04:32,023 --> 00:04:33,233
Asuna: OKAY.

54
00:04:34,983 --> 00:04:36,863
I HOPE THEY CAN HELP HIM.

55
00:04:36,863 --> 00:04:38,993
DO YOU KNOW
IF HE’S HERE ALREADY?

56
00:04:38,993 --> 00:04:41,073
Suguha: YEAH.
THE NURSE ON THE PHONE

57
00:04:41,073 --> 00:04:43,323
SAID THEY BROUGHT HIM OVER
EARLIER TODAY.

58
00:04:43,323 --> 00:04:46,373
Kikuoka: THERE’S ONLY
ONE HOSPITAL IN THE WORLD

59
00:04:46,373 --> 00:04:48,123
THAT HAS THE RIGHT EQUIPMENT.

60
00:04:48,123 --> 00:04:52,373
IF HE GOES THERE, KAZUTO WILL
HAVE THE BEST TREATMENT.

61
00:04:56,213 --> 00:04:58,303
Asuna: HI. WE’RE HERE
TO VISIT A PATIENT.

62
00:05:00,633 --> 00:05:02,803
Receptionist: "KAZUTO KIRIGAYA."

63
00:05:02,803 --> 00:05:04,933
ONE MOMENT,
AND I’LL LOOK HIM UP.

64
00:05:04,933 --> 00:05:06,763
- UH...
- Asuna: HUH?

65
00:05:06,763 --> 00:05:08,563
Receptionist: UM, I’M SORRY.

66
00:05:08,563 --> 00:05:10,483
I HAVE TO CHECK
WITH MY SUPERVISOR.

67
00:05:10,483 --> 00:05:11,563
PLEASE WAIT HERE.

68
00:05:16,023 --> 00:05:18,113
Lisbeth: WHY WOULDN’T
THEY LET YOU SEE HIM?

69
00:05:18,113 --> 00:05:19,943
Asuna: THEY SAID IT HAS TO DO

70
00:05:19,943 --> 00:05:21,613
WITH THE EQUIPMENT
THEY’RE USING.

71
00:05:21,613 --> 00:05:23,993
HE CAN’T HAVE VISITORS
UNTIL HE’S RECOVERED.

72
00:05:23,993 --> 00:05:26,703
Silica: BUT THEY CAN’T DO THAT.
THAT’S TOTALLY ILLEGAL.

73
00:05:26,703 --> 00:05:28,703
YOU’RE FAMILY.

74
00:05:28,703 --> 00:05:31,083
HOSPITALS CAN’T KEEP A PATIENT’S
FAMILY FROM VISITING.

75
00:05:31,083 --> 00:05:32,963
Sinon: SHE’S RIGHT.
THIS SOUNDS FISHY.

76
00:05:32,963 --> 00:05:34,673
Asuna: YES, IT DOES,

77
00:05:34,673 --> 00:05:37,673
SO WE DUG AROUND TO SEE
IF WE COULD FIND ANYTHING.

78
00:05:37,673 --> 00:05:40,053
Suguha: THE HOSPITAL RECORDS SAY
HE’S REGISTERED AS A PATIENT,

79
00:05:40,053 --> 00:05:42,843
BUT THEN I NOTICED
SOMETHING THAT DIDN’T MESH.

80
00:05:42,843 --> 00:05:45,803
THE AMBULANCE TRANSPORTING HIM
NEVER STOPPED THERE.

81
00:05:45,803 --> 00:05:47,723
Silica: THAT DOESN’T
MAKE ANY SENSE.

82
00:05:47,723 --> 00:05:50,103
IF THEY DIDN’T TAKE HIM THERE,
THEN WHERE DID THEY?

83
00:05:50,103 --> 00:05:52,183
Sinon: WHAT DOES KIKUOKA
HAVE TO SAY ABOUT THIS?

84
00:05:52,183 --> 00:05:56,103
Asuna: HE HASN’T RETURNED
ANY OF MY CALLS OR MY EMAILS,

85
00:05:56,103 --> 00:05:57,483
AND THE MINISTRY SAID

86
00:05:57,483 --> 00:05:59,773
HE’S BEEN OUT SINCE YESTERDAY
ON BUSINESS.

87
00:05:59,773 --> 00:06:02,693
Lisbeth: I BET. THAT CREEP’S
TOTALLY AVOIDING YOU!

88
00:06:02,693 --> 00:06:06,073
NO MATTER HOW YOU SLICE IT,
HE’S UP TO SOMETHING SUSPICIOUS.

89
00:06:06,073 --> 00:06:08,823
Sinon: YEAH,
BUT THE QUESTION IS, WHAT?

90
00:06:08,823 --> 00:06:10,123
I DON’T TRUST HIM.

91
00:06:10,123 --> 00:06:12,453
FOR ALL WE KNOW,
HE COULD BE MAKING KIRITO

92
00:06:12,453 --> 00:06:15,083
DO SOME KIND
OF WEIRD V.R. EXPERIMENT.

93
00:06:15,083 --> 00:06:19,043
Silica: BUT HOW? KIRITO CAN’T
DO ANYTHING IF HE’S UNCONSCIOUS.

94
00:06:19,043 --> 00:06:20,923
Sinon: MAYBE HE CAN, THOUGH.

95
00:06:20,923 --> 00:06:23,173
WHAT I MEAN IS, SURE,

96
00:06:23,173 --> 00:06:25,553
KIRITO’S BODY
CAN’T DO ANYTHING NOW,

97
00:06:25,553 --> 00:06:26,973
BUT THAT DOESN’T MATTER,

98
00:06:26,973 --> 00:06:29,013
SINCE THEY HAVE A RIG
THAT CAN ACCESS HIS SOUL.

99
00:06:29,013 --> 00:06:30,013
( Asuna gasps )

100
00:06:30,013 --> 00:06:32,013
THE SOUL TRANSLATOR.

101
00:06:32,013 --> 00:06:33,983
Sinon: MM-HMM.

102
00:06:33,983 --> 00:06:36,313
Silica:
WHAT’S A SOUL TRANSLATOR?

103
00:06:36,313 --> 00:06:37,853
Lisbeth: I NEVER HEARD OF IT.

104
00:06:37,853 --> 00:06:39,363
Asuna: IT’S A NEW
FULL-DIVE MACHINE

105
00:06:39,363 --> 00:06:42,613
THAT CAN ACCESS AND INTERFACE
WITH HUMAN SOULS.

106
00:06:42,613 --> 00:06:45,113
A COMPANY CALLED RATH
IS THE ONE DEVELOPING IT.

107
00:06:45,113 --> 00:06:47,033
Suguha: WHOA, HANG ON. RATH?

108
00:06:47,033 --> 00:06:49,783
THOSE ARE THE PEOPLE KAZUTO
HAS BEEN WORKING PART-TIME FOR.

109
00:06:49,783 --> 00:06:51,743
Asuna: DID HE TELL YOU
ANYTHING ABOUT THEM?

110
00:06:51,743 --> 00:06:54,753
Suguha: NO.
NOTHING SPECIFIC, REALLY.

111
00:06:54,753 --> 00:06:57,083
HE DID SAY THEY WERE
BASED IN ROPPONGI,

112
00:06:57,083 --> 00:06:58,373
BUT THAT’S ABOUT IT.

113
00:06:58,373 --> 00:07:00,293
Sinon: OKAY,
IF THAT’S WHERE THEY ARE,

114
00:07:00,293 --> 00:07:01,883
THAT’S WHERE
WE SHOULD START LOOKING.

115
00:07:01,883 --> 00:07:04,213
Asuna: ACTUALLY THERE MIGHT BE

116
00:07:04,213 --> 00:07:06,673
ANOTHER WAY
TO TRACK KIRITO’S LOCATION.

117
00:07:06,673 --> 00:07:08,683
IT’S KIND OF
A LONG SHOT, THOUGH.

118
00:07:08,683 --> 00:07:10,143
Sinon: WHAT IS IT?

119
00:07:10,143 --> 00:07:12,473
Asuna: I TOLD YOU ABOUT IT
THE OTHER DAY, REMEMBER?

120
00:07:15,683 --> 00:07:18,393
THE APP HE MADE, THIS THING.

121
00:07:18,393 --> 00:07:21,063
Sinon: OH! RIGHT,
HIS LITTLE HEART MONITOR.

122
00:07:21,063 --> 00:07:22,863
Silica: WAIT. WHAT?
HEART MONITOR?

123
00:07:22,863 --> 00:07:25,233
Asuna: I LOST THE SIGNAL TO HIM
A WHILE AGO,

124
00:07:25,233 --> 00:07:28,653
BUT I HAVE SOMEONE TRACING
HIS LAST KNOWN COORDINATES NOW.

125
00:07:28,653 --> 00:07:29,913
Sinon: WHO?

126
00:07:29,913 --> 00:07:31,913
Asuna: HEY, YUI, YOU THERE?

127
00:07:31,913 --> 00:07:34,333
Yui: YES!

128
00:07:34,333 --> 00:07:37,333
I JUST FINISHED ANALYZING
ALL THE DATA.

129
00:07:37,333 --> 00:07:41,793
I’LL TRACK THE COORDINATES
FROM DADDY’S BIO-MONITOR NOW.

130
00:07:41,793 --> 00:07:44,843
THIS ONE IS THE PLACE
WHERE DADDY STARTED,

131
00:07:44,843 --> 00:07:47,173
SETAGAYA GENERAL HOSPITAL.

132
00:07:47,173 --> 00:07:50,263
THIS ONE IS THE FIRST LOCATION

133
00:07:50,263 --> 00:07:52,303
DADDY’S MONITOR
PINGED A CELL TOWER,

134
00:07:52,303 --> 00:07:55,313
AOBADAI BLOCK THREE,
MEGURO WARD.

135
00:07:55,313 --> 00:07:59,893
THE TIME STAMP IS 20:50
ON JUNE 29, 2026.

136
00:07:59,893 --> 00:08:03,403
HERE IS DADDY’S
PREDICTED ROUTE.

137
00:08:03,403 --> 00:08:06,033
THE NEXT TIME HE PINGED
WAS HERE,

138
00:08:06,033 --> 00:08:10,863
SHIROKANEDAI BLOCK ONE,
MINATO WARD, AT 21:10.

139
00:08:10,863 --> 00:08:13,123
AND LAST...

140
00:08:15,203 --> 00:08:18,123
HE PINGED AGAIN
AT KAIGAN BLOCK TWO,

141
00:08:18,123 --> 00:08:20,463
MINATO WARD, AT 21:20.

142
00:08:20,463 --> 00:08:23,083
AND THAT’S IT.
I CHECKED ALL THE PACKETS,

143
00:08:23,083 --> 00:08:24,883
THERE HAVE BEEN
NO FURTHER PINGS.

144
00:08:24,883 --> 00:08:27,963
Suguha: HE’S NOT
IN TOKOROZAWA OR ROPPONGI.

145
00:08:27,963 --> 00:08:31,843
Asuna: YUI, WHAT’S
AT THAT LAST ADDRESS YOU HAVE?

146
00:08:31,843 --> 00:08:35,053
Yui: ALL I CAN TELL IS THAT
IT IS SOME SORT OF WAREHOUSE.

147
00:08:35,053 --> 00:08:37,143
Sinon: WHY WOULD THEY
TAKE HIM OUT THERE?

148
00:08:37,143 --> 00:08:37,893
( Asuna gasps )

149
00:08:37,893 --> 00:08:39,773
MINATO WARD.

150
00:08:41,103 --> 00:08:42,773
( stereo playing music )

151
00:08:47,733 --> 00:08:49,693
( singing in Japanese )

152
00:08:52,913 --> 00:08:54,873
Klein: ALMOST THERE.
THIS TIME OF NIGHT,

153
00:08:54,873 --> 00:08:57,123
THERE AIN’T TOO MUCH TRAFFIC
HEADIN’ THIS WAY.

154
00:08:57,123 --> 00:08:58,453
Asuna: THANKS, KLEIN.

155
00:08:58,453 --> 00:09:01,123
I REALLY APPRECIATE
YOU DRIVING US OUT HERE.

156
00:09:01,123 --> 00:09:02,873
Klein: AH, COME ON.
QUIT THANKIN’ ME.

157
00:09:02,873 --> 00:09:05,253
I’D DO ANYTHING FOR YOU GUYS.

158
00:09:05,253 --> 00:09:08,053
CAN’T BELIEVE WE WERE ALL HAVING
FUN IN "GGO" THE OTHER DAY,

159
00:09:08,053 --> 00:09:09,343
AND NOW...

160
00:09:09,343 --> 00:09:12,303
WELL, I JUST HOPE HE’S OKAY.

161
00:09:12,303 --> 00:09:14,593
Suguha: I JUST HOPE
HE STOPS GETTING MIXED UP

162
00:09:14,593 --> 00:09:16,353
IN WEIRD EXPERIMENTS
AFTER THIS.

163
00:09:16,353 --> 00:09:17,813
Klein: DIDN’T YOU GUYS SAY

164
00:09:17,813 --> 00:09:20,183
THIS RATH COMPANY
WAS IN ROPPONGI?

165
00:09:20,183 --> 00:09:22,983
SHOULDN’T WE BE
LOOKING FOR HIM THERE, TOO?

166
00:09:22,983 --> 00:09:24,313
Suguha: ACTUALLY...

167
00:09:24,313 --> 00:09:27,273
SINON AND THE OTHERS
SHOULD BE THERE BY NOW.

168
00:09:27,273 --> 00:09:31,533
Asuna: IT’S SO WEIRD.
THERE’S NO INFO ON RATH AT ALL.

169
00:09:31,533 --> 00:09:34,363
YUI CHECKED ALL
THE PUBLIC RECORDS, EVERYTHING.

170
00:09:34,363 --> 00:09:36,493
ALL SHE FOUND
WAS THEIR ADDRESS.

171
00:09:36,493 --> 00:09:39,583
THERE WAS NOTHING ABOUT
THE COMPANY OR WHAT THEY DID.

172
00:09:39,583 --> 00:09:42,543
Suguha: THE SAME WITH
THAT SOUL TRANSLATOR THING.

173
00:09:42,543 --> 00:09:45,083
IF IT’S NEW TECH,
NO ONE’S TALKING ABOUT IT.

174
00:09:45,083 --> 00:09:47,963
WE COULDN’T FIND PATENT
APPLICATIONS OR COPYRIGHTS.

175
00:09:47,963 --> 00:09:50,173
Klein: A MACHINE THAT
CAN INTERFACE WITH THE SOUL

176
00:09:50,173 --> 00:09:51,513
IS THE BIGGEST DEAL EVER.

177
00:09:51,513 --> 00:09:53,513
YOU KNOW
WHO DOESN’T PATENT THAT?

178
00:09:53,513 --> 00:09:55,683
SNEAKY BASTARDS, THAT’S WHO.

179
00:09:55,683 --> 00:09:57,933
OH, COOL! WE’RE ALMOST THERE.

180
00:10:04,193 --> 00:10:06,693
THAT’S IT, HUH?

181
00:10:06,693 --> 00:10:09,363
I DON’T GET IT. WHAT’S THE POINT

182
00:10:09,363 --> 00:10:12,233
OF STASHING KIRI-DUDE
OUT HERE BY THE DOCKS?

183
00:10:12,233 --> 00:10:14,283
- ( cell phone buzzing )
- ( Asuna stammers )

184
00:10:17,033 --> 00:10:19,163
HEY, LIZ.

185
00:10:19,163 --> 00:10:22,333
Lisbeth: WE’RE OUT IN FRONT
OF RATH’S OFFICE NOW.

186
00:10:22,333 --> 00:10:24,003
THEIR SECURITY’S SUPER TIGHT,

187
00:10:24,003 --> 00:10:25,793
AND THEY WOULDN’T
TELL US A THING.

188
00:10:25,793 --> 00:10:28,213
OH, AND THERE’S
CAMERAS ALL AROUND,

189
00:10:28,213 --> 00:10:31,133
SO WE ASKED YUI
TO CHECK OUT THE FOOTAGE.

190
00:10:31,133 --> 00:10:34,013
AS FAR AS SHE COULD TELL,
THEY DIDN’T BRING KIRITO HERE.

191
00:10:34,013 --> 00:10:36,633
Asuna: OKAY.
I’LL CALL YOU LATER.

192
00:10:38,093 --> 00:10:39,223
HEY, YUI.

193
00:10:39,223 --> 00:10:40,933
Yui: HERE, MOMMY.

194
00:10:40,933 --> 00:10:43,523
I JUST CHECKED ALL THE SECURITY
CAMERAS IN THE HARBOR.

195
00:10:45,683 --> 00:10:48,483
THIS PROPERTY HAS
A HELIPAD OVER THERE.

196
00:10:48,483 --> 00:10:52,573
YESTERDAY, AT 21:20,
A HELICOPTER TOOK OFF FROM IT.

197
00:10:52,573 --> 00:10:54,363
Asuna: DO YOU KNOW
IF HE WAS ON IT?

198
00:10:54,363 --> 00:10:58,163
Yui: WELL, I CAN’T CONFIRM,
BUT I BELIEVE HE WAS.

199
00:10:58,163 --> 00:10:59,873
( Suguha gasps ) OH, MY GOD.

200
00:10:59,873 --> 00:11:02,583
THEY COULD HAVE TAKEN HIM
ANYWHERE THEN. NOW WHAT?

201
00:11:02,583 --> 00:11:03,913
Asuna:
WAIT. LET’S NOT PANIC.

202
00:11:03,913 --> 00:11:05,083
YUI.

203
00:11:05,083 --> 00:11:07,043
JUST CONFIRMING,

204
00:11:07,043 --> 00:11:09,293
THIS IS THE LAST PLACE
HIS SIGNAL SHOWED UP?

205
00:11:09,293 --> 00:11:10,753
Yui: YES, IT IS.

206
00:11:10,753 --> 00:11:12,423
Asuna: HE NEEDS TREATMENT,

207
00:11:12,423 --> 00:11:15,173
SO THEY’LL HAVE TO TAKE HIM
TO SOME KIND OF FACILITY.

208
00:11:15,173 --> 00:11:17,053
BUT IF THEY LANDED,

209
00:11:17,053 --> 00:11:19,723
KIRITO’S SIGNAL SHOULD HAVE
POPPED UP AGAIN BY NOW,

210
00:11:19,723 --> 00:11:22,763
UNLESS WHEREVER HE IS
IS OUT OF RANGE.

211
00:11:22,763 --> 00:11:25,063
Yui: YES, THAT MUST BE THE CASE.

212
00:11:25,063 --> 00:11:27,273
IT’S POSSIBLE THEY TOOK HIM
OUT OF THE COUNTRY.

213
00:11:27,273 --> 00:11:28,813
Klein: SAY WHAT?!

214
00:11:28,813 --> 00:11:30,443
Yui: IT’S ONE POSSIBILITY.

215
00:11:30,443 --> 00:11:32,363
IT’S ALSO THE MOST LIKELY.

216
00:11:32,363 --> 00:11:34,363
Klein: WHAT DO WE DO?

217
00:11:34,363 --> 00:11:36,653
HE COULD BE ANYWHERE
IN THE WORLD BY NOW.

218
00:11:36,653 --> 00:11:39,823
Suguha: HE’S RIGHT. HOW THE HECK
ARE WE GONNA FIND HIM?

219
00:11:41,073 --> 00:11:43,033
Asuna: KIRITO.

220
00:11:43,033 --> 00:11:46,453
Yui: CHEER UP, MOMMY. HAVE HOPE.

221
00:11:46,453 --> 00:11:47,753
Asuna: I’M TRYING.

222
00:11:47,753 --> 00:11:49,623
Yui: WHEN YOU
WERE TRAPPED IN ALFHEIM,

223
00:11:49,623 --> 00:11:52,043
DADDY SEARCHED
ALL OVER FOR YOU.

224
00:11:52,043 --> 00:11:54,753
HE NEVER GAVE UP,
AND EVENTUALLY, HE FOUND YOU!

225
00:11:54,753 --> 00:11:55,963
Asuna: I KNOW.

226
00:11:55,963 --> 00:11:57,263
Yui: THEN CHEER UP!

227
00:11:57,263 --> 00:11:59,473
NOW IT’S YOUR TURN
TO SEARCH FOR HIM!

228
00:11:59,473 --> 00:12:01,093
I KNOW YOU’LL FIND A CLUE

229
00:12:01,093 --> 00:12:03,053
THAT WILL LEAD YOU
STRAIGHT TO DADDY.

230
00:12:03,053 --> 00:12:06,523
AND IF ANYONE STANDS
IN YOUR WAY, THEY’LL BE SORRY.

231
00:12:06,523 --> 00:12:10,023
BECAUSE NOTHING, NO ONE,
CAN SEVER THE BOND BETWEEN YOU.

232
00:12:10,023 --> 00:12:11,943
♪

233
00:12:23,123 --> 00:12:25,373
Asuna: IT DIDN’T MATTER
WHAT DANGERS HE FACED.

234
00:12:25,373 --> 00:12:27,703
KIRITO NEVER BACKED DOWN.

235
00:12:29,253 --> 00:12:30,583
I’LL FIND HIM,

236
00:12:30,583 --> 00:12:33,043
IF IT’S THE LAST THING I DO.

237
00:12:33,043 --> 00:12:35,293
THANKS FOR THE PEP TALK, YUI.

238
00:12:35,293 --> 00:12:37,763
YOU’RE RIGHT. I WON’T GIVE UP.

239
00:12:37,763 --> 00:12:40,933
( Yui giggles )
THAT’S THE SPIRIT!

240
00:12:40,933 --> 00:12:42,513
Asuna: LET’S THINK
FOR A SEC HERE.

241
00:12:42,513 --> 00:12:44,723
WHAT DO WE KNOW ABOUT RATH?

242
00:12:44,723 --> 00:12:48,313
ASSUMING THEY’RE THE ONES
WHO HAVE KIRITO NOW.

243
00:12:48,313 --> 00:12:51,983
SUGUHA, DID KIRITO EVER
TELL YOU ANYTHING ABOUT THEM,

244
00:12:51,983 --> 00:12:53,693
ANYTHING AT ALL?

245
00:12:53,693 --> 00:12:55,563
Suguha: I HAVEN’T
SEEN HIM THAT MUCH LATELY

246
00:12:55,563 --> 00:12:56,983
’CAUSE OF HIS WORK.

247
00:12:56,983 --> 00:13:00,073
WE TALKED A BIT
NOW AND THEN, BUT NOT MUCH.

248
00:13:00,073 --> 00:13:02,243
YOU KNOW WHAT?
COME TO THINK OF IT,

249
00:13:02,243 --> 00:13:03,953
HE DID SAY SOMETHING ONCE,

250
00:13:03,953 --> 00:13:06,373
SOMETHING ABOUT
HOW THAT MACHINE HE WAS TESTING

251
00:13:06,373 --> 00:13:08,333
WAS BASED ON THE MEDICUBOID.

252
00:13:08,333 --> 00:13:11,583
Asuna: THEY SHARE THE SAME TECH?
I HAD NO IDEA.

253
00:13:11,583 --> 00:13:14,633
THE MEDICUBOID.

254
00:13:14,633 --> 00:13:17,423
I JUST REMEMBERED
SOMETHING HE TOLD ME.

255
00:13:17,423 --> 00:13:19,303
YOU KNOW
WHO DESIGNED THE MEDICUBOID?

256
00:13:19,303 --> 00:13:22,173
THE COMMANDER, AKIHIKO KAYABA.

257
00:13:22,173 --> 00:13:24,263
HE LAID THE GROUNDWORK,

258
00:13:24,263 --> 00:13:26,303
BUT HIS PARTNER DEVELOPED IT
FOR HOSPITALS.

259
00:13:26,303 --> 00:13:28,723
Kirito: YEAH, IN FACT,
SHE WAS TAKING CARE

260
00:13:28,723 --> 00:13:31,273
OF HEATHCLIFF’S BODY
WHILE HE WAS DIVING.

261
00:13:31,273 --> 00:13:33,143
SHE WAS HIS HEAD RESEARCHER.

262
00:13:33,143 --> 00:13:36,403
SHE HELPED HIM DEVELOP
FULL-DIVE TECHNOLOGY.

263
00:13:36,403 --> 00:13:38,363
Asuna: WHAT WAS HER NAME?

264
00:13:38,363 --> 00:13:41,573
RINKO KOJIRO, I THINK.

265
00:13:41,573 --> 00:13:44,783
Yui: I’LL RUN A SEARCH.

266
00:13:44,783 --> 00:13:47,993
I FOUND SOMEONE WHO’S MOST
LIKELY THE PERSON YOU MENTIONED.

267
00:13:47,993 --> 00:13:50,243
CURRENTLY, SHE’S A RESEARCHER

268
00:13:50,243 --> 00:13:52,413
AT THE CALIFORNIA
TECHNOLOGICAL INSTITUTE.

269
00:13:52,413 --> 00:13:54,253
THIS IS HER.

270
00:13:54,253 --> 00:13:58,633
THE UNIVERSITY’S DATABASE
DETAILS HER CAREER SO FAR.

271
00:13:58,633 --> 00:14:01,013
SHE’S A FORMER MEMBER
OF THE SHIGEMURA LAB

272
00:14:01,013 --> 00:14:03,173
AT TOTO INSTITUTE
OF TECHNOLOGY’S

273
00:14:03,173 --> 00:14:05,723
DEPARTMENT OF ELECTRICAL
AND ELECTRONIC ENGINEERING.

274
00:14:05,723 --> 00:14:09,563
Suguha: WAIT. ISN’T SHIGEMURA
THE GUY WHO MADE THE AUGMA?

275
00:14:09,563 --> 00:14:12,933
Asuna: YEAH, AND KAYABA
WAS ONE OF HIS STUDENTS.

276
00:14:15,443 --> 00:14:19,903
SHE MIGHT KNOW SOMETHING
ABOUT THE S.T.L. AND RATH.

277
00:14:32,953 --> 00:14:34,583
( Rinko sighs )

278
00:14:43,133 --> 00:14:45,803
WAIT. A FLOATING CASTLE?

279
00:14:45,803 --> 00:14:50,433
Kayaba: YEAH. A CASTLE
IN THE SKY WITH NUMEROUS FLOORS,

280
00:14:50,433 --> 00:14:52,723
100 FLOORS, MAYBE,

281
00:14:52,723 --> 00:14:56,693
AND EACH ONE HAS A TOWN,
A FOREST, AND A PLAIN.

282
00:14:56,693 --> 00:15:01,273
TO GET TO THE NEXT FLOOR,
YOU CLIMB A LONG STAIRCASE,

283
00:15:01,273 --> 00:15:04,193
AND WHEN YOU REACH THE TOP,
YOU’LL FIND A PALACE.

284
00:15:04,193 --> 00:15:07,073
Rinko: SO WHAT’S IN THE PALACE?

285
00:15:07,073 --> 00:15:08,493
Kayaba: I DON’T KNOW.

286
00:15:09,623 --> 00:15:11,453
WHEN I WAS YOUNG,

287
00:15:11,453 --> 00:15:15,453
I USED TO GO TO THAT CASTLE
EVERY NIGHT IN MY DREAMS.

288
00:15:15,453 --> 00:15:18,503
EVERY NIGHT,
I’D CLIMB UP EACH STAIRCASE

289
00:15:18,503 --> 00:15:23,093
AND GET CLOSER TO THE TOP,
BIT BY BIT.

290
00:15:23,093 --> 00:15:24,633
BUT THEN, AT SOME POINT,

291
00:15:24,633 --> 00:15:28,013
( sighs )
I WASN’T ABLE TO GO THERE AGAIN.

292
00:15:31,433 --> 00:15:33,013
( sighs )

293
00:15:36,313 --> 00:15:38,643
IT WAS JUST A SILLY DREAM.

294
00:15:38,643 --> 00:15:40,943
I PRETTY MUCH FORGOT
ALL ABOUT IT.

295
00:15:49,283 --> 00:15:50,783
Rinko: LIAR.

296
00:15:53,623 --> 00:15:55,583
( computer chimes )

297
00:15:55,583 --> 00:15:56,833
NOT AGAIN.

298
00:15:58,163 --> 00:15:58,833
HMM?

299
00:16:01,583 --> 00:16:03,463
ASUNA YUUKI?

300
00:16:12,513 --> 00:16:15,393
Pilot: ALMOST THERE.

301
00:16:15,393 --> 00:16:17,273
YOU’LL SEE THE OCEAN TURTLE
IN A SEC.

302
00:16:19,273 --> 00:16:21,483
♪

303
00:16:29,073 --> 00:16:30,823
Rinko: WHY "TURTLE"?

304
00:16:30,823 --> 00:16:33,953
OH, SEE IT.
YEAH, I GUESS IT LOOKS LIKE ONE.

305
00:16:35,833 --> 00:16:38,293
LOOKS MORE LIKE A PIG
FROM HERE, THOUGH.

306
00:16:40,503 --> 00:16:42,253
OR A PIG-TURTLE.

307
00:16:42,253 --> 00:16:44,173
WASN’T THERE
A CREATURE LIKE THAT

308
00:16:44,173 --> 00:16:46,463
IN THE "ALICE IN WONDERLAND"
BOOK?

309
00:16:46,463 --> 00:16:48,053
Woman: RATH.

310
00:17:11,783 --> 00:17:14,533
Man: DR. KOJIRO. WELCOME ABOARD.

311
00:17:14,533 --> 00:17:15,913
AND WHO THIS IS?

312
00:17:17,583 --> 00:17:19,703
Rinko: THIS IS MY ASSISTANT,
MAYUMI REYNOLDS.

313
00:17:21,123 --> 00:17:22,713
Mayumi: IT’S NICE TO MEET YOU.

314
00:17:24,963 --> 00:17:28,503
Nakanishi: LIKEWISE.
MY NAME IS LIEUTENANT NAKANISHI.

315
00:17:28,503 --> 00:17:30,213
I’LL ESCORT YOU BELOW DECK.

316
00:17:30,213 --> 00:17:32,093
THIS WAY. WATCH YOUR STEP.

317
00:17:37,973 --> 00:17:41,483
I NEED YOU TO VERIFY DR. KOJIRO
AND HER ASSISTANT, MS. REYNOLDS,

318
00:17:41,483 --> 00:17:43,273
FOR ACCESS TO SECTOR S-3.

319
00:17:43,273 --> 00:17:44,353
Guard: RIGHT AWAY, SIR.

320
00:17:49,193 --> 00:17:50,613
I.D. VERIFIED.

321
00:17:50,613 --> 00:17:52,403
I’M SORRY, MA’AM.

322
00:17:52,403 --> 00:17:54,533
YOU’LL HAVE TO REMOVE
YOUR SUNGLASSES FOR THIS.

323
00:17:54,533 --> 00:17:55,783
Mayumi: SURE.

324
00:17:58,163 --> 00:18:00,793
Guard: I.D. VERIFIED. PROCEED.

325
00:18:01,873 --> 00:18:04,583
( Rinko sighs )

326
00:18:04,583 --> 00:18:07,083
SECURITY’S AWFULLY TIGHT HERE.

327
00:18:07,083 --> 00:18:09,503
YOU’D THINK THE MIDDLE
OF THE OCEAN WAS SAFE.

328
00:18:09,503 --> 00:18:11,303
Nakanishi:
ACTUALLY, WE’RE REQUIRED

329
00:18:11,303 --> 00:18:13,633
TO RUN FULL-BODY CHECKS
ON GUESTS.

330
00:18:13,633 --> 00:18:15,093
BUT YOU’VE GONE THROUGH

331
00:18:15,093 --> 00:18:17,973
THREE METAL AND EXPLOSIVES
DETECTORS ALREADY, SO...

332
00:18:24,603 --> 00:18:26,193
( Rinko gasps )

333
00:18:41,833 --> 00:18:43,833
Kikuoka:
WELCOME TO RATH, DOCTOR.

334
00:18:43,833 --> 00:18:45,753
( Rinko grunts ) KIKUOKA.

335
00:18:45,753 --> 00:18:49,753
SORRY, LIEUTENANT COLONEL.

336
00:18:49,753 --> 00:18:51,923
YOU LOOK COMFY.
WHERE’S YOUR UNIFORM?

337
00:18:51,923 --> 00:18:54,723
Nakanishi: UM, SIR, I’LL BE
ON THE COMMS IF YOU NEED ME.

338
00:18:56,433 --> 00:18:57,843
Kikuoka:
I’VE BEEN STUCK OUT HERE

339
00:18:57,843 --> 00:19:00,763
IN THE MIDDLE OF THE OCEAN
FOR ABOUT A MONTH NOW.

340
00:19:00,763 --> 00:19:04,063
I CAN’T ALWAYS BE IN A UNIFORM
OR A SUIT FOR THAT MATTER.

341
00:19:04,063 --> 00:19:06,353
- I CAN’T BEGIN TO TELL YOU
- ( sandals clicking )

342
00:19:06,353 --> 00:19:09,063
HOW HAPPY I AM
TO FINALLY HAVE YOU HERE.

343
00:19:09,063 --> 00:19:12,023
I WAS STARTING TO WORRY
MY PERSISTENCE SCARED YOU AWAY.

344
00:19:12,023 --> 00:19:13,443
Rinko: JUST BECAUSE I’M HERE

345
00:19:13,443 --> 00:19:14,613
DOESN’T MEAN
I’VE AGREED TO ANYTHING.

346
00:19:14,613 --> 00:19:15,743
Kikuoka: HMM?

347
00:19:15,743 --> 00:19:18,703
( sighs )

348
00:19:18,703 --> 00:19:21,743
FAIR ENOUGH,
BUT BEFORE YOU DECIDE ANYTHING,

349
00:19:21,743 --> 00:19:23,793
YOU SHOULD KNOW
YOU’RE ONE OF THREE PEOPLE

350
00:19:23,793 --> 00:19:26,753
WHOSE SKILLS ARE CRUCIAL
TO THIS PROJECT,

351
00:19:26,753 --> 00:19:29,043
AND NOW YOU’RE ALL HERE.

352
00:19:29,043 --> 00:19:31,383
Rinko: HMM. CONGRATULATIONS.

353
00:19:31,383 --> 00:19:33,593
WELL, WELL, LOOK WHO IT IS.

354
00:19:33,593 --> 00:19:36,843
DON’T TELL ME HE ROPED YOU IN
ON THIS TOO, HIGA.

355
00:19:36,843 --> 00:19:39,303
Higa: WHAT DO YOU THINK?
OF COURSE HE DID!

356
00:19:39,303 --> 00:19:41,603
HONESTLY, I’M STOKED TO BE HERE.

357
00:19:41,603 --> 00:19:44,063
I’M CARRYING ON THE LEGACY
OF SHIGEMURA LAB.

358
00:19:44,063 --> 00:19:47,603
Rinko: I SWEAR, YOU HAVEN’T
CHANGED A BIT, HAVE YOU?

359
00:19:47,603 --> 00:19:50,603
WELL, WHO’S THE THIRD PERSON
YOU MENTIONED?

360
00:19:50,603 --> 00:19:54,023
Kikuoka: UNFORTUNATELY,
I CAN’T INTRODUCE YOU NOW,

361
00:19:54,023 --> 00:19:56,613
BUT DON’T WORRY.
IN A FEW DAYS, I’LL SHOW--

362
00:19:56,613 --> 00:19:58,153
Asuna: MR. KIKUOKA...

363
00:19:58,153 --> 00:20:00,533
- YOU’LL TAKE US TO HIM NOW.
- ( Kikuoka gasps )

364
00:20:04,123 --> 00:20:07,623
A-ASUNA, I--
WH-WHAT ARE YOU DOING HERE?

365
00:20:07,623 --> 00:20:10,043
Rinko: SHE SENT ME
AN INTERESTING EMAIL.

366
00:20:14,343 --> 00:20:16,253
Asuna: AN ORGANIZATION
CALLED RATH

367
00:20:16,253 --> 00:20:19,133
IS DEVELOPING A MACHINE
CALLED THE SOUL TRANSLATOR.

368
00:20:19,133 --> 00:20:21,013
IT’S BASED ON THE MEDICUBOID,

369
00:20:21,013 --> 00:20:24,263
THE MEDICAL FULL-DIVE RIG
YOU DESIGNED THE TECHNOLOGY FOR.

370
00:20:25,973 --> 00:20:29,103
KAZUTO KIRIGAYA
WAS TESTING THIS NEW MACHINE,

371
00:20:29,103 --> 00:20:32,943
BUT HE DISAPPEARED, AND I
NEED YOUR HELP TO FIND HIM.

372
00:20:32,943 --> 00:20:35,443
Rinko: KAZUTO KIRIGAYA?

373
00:20:35,443 --> 00:20:38,363
Kirito: I WAS
IN THE OLD "S.A.O." SERVER,

374
00:20:38,363 --> 00:20:40,953
AND I MET KAYABA’S
DIGITAL GHOST THERE.

375
00:20:40,953 --> 00:20:42,573
( Rinko gasps )

376
00:20:42,573 --> 00:20:44,073
Kirito: WE SPOKE.

377
00:20:44,073 --> 00:20:46,743
HE GAVE ME A PROGRAM
CALLED THE SEED.

378
00:20:46,743 --> 00:20:50,713
DO YOU KNOW IT? IF YOU DO,
I’D LIKE TO GET YOUR THOUGHTS.

379
00:20:50,713 --> 00:20:52,423
( Rinko sighs )

380
00:20:54,583 --> 00:20:56,883
IF YOU HATE HIM
FOR WHAT HE DID,

381
00:20:56,883 --> 00:20:59,383
THEN JUST DELETE IT,
AND FORGET ALL ABOUT IT.

382
00:20:59,383 --> 00:21:02,683
IT’S OKAY, REALLY. END IT.

383
00:21:02,683 --> 00:21:04,393
BUT IF THERE’S
STILL A PART OF YOU

384
00:21:04,393 --> 00:21:05,763
THAT SEES V.R.’S POTENTIAL...

385
00:21:08,103 --> 00:21:11,563
Asuna: AFTER KIRITO DISAPPEARED,
I WENT THROUGH HIS CONTACTS,

386
00:21:11,563 --> 00:21:13,813
AND THAT’S WHERE
I FOUND YOUR EMAIL.

387
00:21:13,813 --> 00:21:16,483
IF YOU KNOW ANYTHING ABOUT RATH,
ANYTHING AT ALL,

388
00:21:16,483 --> 00:21:18,153
IT COULD HELP ME FIND HIM.

389
00:21:18,153 --> 00:21:21,033
YOU’RE MY LAST HOPE, DR. KOJIRO.

390
00:21:21,033 --> 00:21:24,113
HELP ME, PLEASE.

391
00:21:24,113 --> 00:21:26,493
Rinko: SORRY.
DID WE SURPRISE YOU?

392
00:21:26,493 --> 00:21:28,243
ARE YOU HAVING
SECOND THOUGHTS NOW

393
00:21:28,243 --> 00:21:31,333
ABOUT INVITING ME TO BE
ON YOUR PROJECT, MR. KIKUOKA?

394
00:21:31,333 --> 00:21:32,713
Kikuoka: APPARENTLY,
OUR SECURITY

395
00:21:32,713 --> 00:21:34,753
WASN’T THOROUGH ENOUGH.

396
00:21:34,753 --> 00:21:37,593
I KNOW WE HAVE YOUR ASSISTANT’S
PHOTO FROM THE UNIVERSITY.

397
00:21:37,593 --> 00:21:39,673
THEY SHOULD HAVE RUN
A PROPER CHECK.

398
00:21:39,673 --> 00:21:41,633
Asuna: THEY DID. ON OUR WAY IN,

399
00:21:41,633 --> 00:21:43,803
THEY SCANNED MY FACE
QUITE A FEW TIMES, IN FACT.

400
00:21:43,803 --> 00:21:47,263
BUT I HAD HER ASSISTANT’S PHOTO
IN THE SCHOOL’S DATABASE

401
00:21:47,263 --> 00:21:48,933
SWITCHED WITH MINE A WHILE AGO.

402
00:21:48,933 --> 00:21:50,183
( Kikuoka gasps )

403
00:21:50,183 --> 00:21:51,563
Asuna: I HAPPEN TO KNOW SOMEONE

404
00:21:51,563 --> 00:21:54,193
WHO’S GREAT
AT BUSTING THROUGH FIREWALLS.

405
00:21:54,193 --> 00:21:55,603
Rinko: RIGHT NOW,
THE REAL MAYUMI

406
00:21:55,603 --> 00:21:58,153
IS PROBABLY ON A BEACH
SOMEWHERE WORKING ON HER TAN.

407
00:22:02,573 --> 00:22:04,653
Asuna: TAKE ME TO KIRITO.

408
00:22:04,653 --> 00:22:05,913
♪

409
00:22:05,913 --> 00:22:07,573
( singing in Japanese )

410
00:22:41,983 --> 00:22:45,823
♪ THE IRIS TO YOU ♪
